  "combination_note": "Written 2026-11-09 about 16:40 Kyiv after the single-axis val_fast screening and before any combination result. Rule 5 stack = flip_nms06 (gain +0.0069) then tile_nms05 (+0.0064). The two winners use different merge IoUs (0.6, 0.5) but the stack has one class-wise NMS over all passes, so both values are evaluated and the better val_fast mAP is the stack candidate. The strict 'flip every pass' reading (full, flip, 4 tiles, 4 flipped tiles = 10 passes) is excluded by rule 3: the measured cache pass times give 0.0728 + 0.0888 + 2 x 0.2935 = 0.749 s/frame = 1.34 FPS < 1.6 FPS (passes/baseline_1344_*_val_fast.json)."
